<title>USA: Green Mountain names Dutton CEO/president.</title>
<headline>Green Mountain names Dutton CEO/president.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH BURLINGTON, Vt. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Green Mountain Power Corp said Wednesday it has elected Christopher Dutton president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>He succeeds president and CEO Douglas Hyde, who chose to become president of the newly-formed Green Mountain Energy Resources LLC, a national retail energy marketing company owned by Green Mountain Power and the Dallas-based Wyly family.</p>
<p>Dutton has been chief financial officer of Green Mountain Power since 1995, and joined the company as general counsel in 1984.</p>
